    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「ふっふっふ、サチエさんとお喋りしてたんですよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「ほら、この猫さんです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 21,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「猫さんと喋ってると、なぜか『にゃん、にゃん♪』言っちゃいますよね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 21,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「ちなみにサチエさんは、うちのガッコ（学校）の神無月ほとり先輩の飼い猫さんです！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 21,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「人生（猫生？）の酸いも甘いも噛みわけた、たいへん偉ぁい猫さんですよ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 21,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「あたし、たまにサチエさんに悩み事とか相談してるんです！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 21,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「サチエさんの含蓄あるアドバイスには、いつも勇気をもらってるよ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 21,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「サチエさん、この神社で『危ないやつ』を見かけたから警備を強化してるんですって。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 21,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「お疲れさまですサチエさん～、うにゃんにゃん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「サチエさんがいるかぎり、この町は安泰です～☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 21,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「ともあれ。転校生の先輩こそ、神社なんかで何してるんです？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「初詣にしても遅い時期ですよね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「あたし？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 21,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「あたしは何かよくわかんないけど、『巫女修行』とかいうのに参加させられそうになって～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 21,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「はげしく面倒くさそうだったから、とりあえず逃げだして、隠れてるんです！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「あたし、『修行』とか『特訓』とか大嫌い～っ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 21,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「うにゃあ？　先輩も、『巫女修行』のお手伝いをしにきたんです？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「そうですか～、先輩は何でもかんでもお手伝いするんですね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 21,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みけ",
    "text": "「だからいつも忙しそうなんだにゃあ、『猫の手も借りたい』って感じ！」"
